{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"卷九百六十三◎竹部二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"○竹下","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"桂竹","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《山海經》曰：雲山有桂竹，甚毒，傷人必死。(郭璞註曰：始興小桂縣出桂竹也。)","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"箭竹","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：東南之美者，有會稽掷犟箭焉。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《禮記》曰：禮之於人也，如竹箭之有蟛蘙。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《說文》曰：箭，矢竹也。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"戴凯之《竹譜》曰：箭竹，高者一丈，節間三尺，堅劲，中為矢。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"桃枝竹","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：桃枝，四寸有節。(今桃枝節間相去多四寸。)","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：桃枝竹，皮滑而黃，可以為席。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《山海經》曰：嶓冢之山，嚣死戤上，多桃枝竹。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"裴氏《廣州記》曰：有桃竹。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《魏志》曰：倭國有桃枝竹。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"篁竹","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：篁竹，似滚狞蘘概節。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"筋竹","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：筋竹，長二丈許，围數寸，至堅利。出日南九真。南方以為矛。其筍未成竹時，堪為弩絃。見徐衷《南中奏》。劉淵林雲：\"夷人以史篻(音瓢。)竹為矛。\"即是筋竹，一物而二名者也。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《永嘉郡記》曰：陽興去安固江口六十五里，有仙石山。顶上有平石，辟方十餘丈，名為仙壇。壇陬有一筋竹，凡有風來，動音自成宮商。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"周景式《庐山記》曰：康皇溪，道士种松及筋竹竿。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"竺法真《登羅山疏》曰：嶺南道無筋竹，惟羅山有之，其大尺围，細者色如黃金，堅貞疏節。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《異苑》曰：東陽留道，先玄嘉四年，筋竹林忽生連理。野人無知，謂為禍祟，斫殺之。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"鉤端竹","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《山海經》曰：嶓冢之山，嚣死瓴當，多鉤端竹。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"筇竹","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《漢書》曰：張騫之大夏，見筇竹杖，問之，雲：\"贾人市之身毒國。\"","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《山海經》曰：龟山多狹竹。(郭璞註曰：即筇竹。)","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：筇竹，高節實中，状若人剡，俗謂之扶老竹。《廣志》雲：\"出南廣邛都縣。\"","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《羅浮山記》曰：邛竹，本出邛山，張騫西至大夏所見也。而此山左右時有之，乡老以為杖。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"种龍竹","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：种龍竹，任作笛。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《呂氏春秋》曰：昔黃帝命伶倫為律。伶倫自大夏之西，乃之沅渝之陰，取竹於嶰穀，斷兩節，間長三寸九分，而吹之，以為黃鍾之宮，律植稻也。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"雲母竹","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：雲母竹，大竹也。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"樆竹","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：樆竹，細而多刺。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"鬴竹","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：{⺮思}竹，任作笛。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：{⺮思}篣竹，皮薄而空多，大者径不逾二寸。皮上有粗涩文，可為错子错甲，利勝於鐵。若钝，以漿水洗之，還复快利。(《廣州記》雲：石麻掷犟，劲而利，削為刀，割像皮如切竽。)","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"狗竹","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：狗竹，節間有毛，晨≠海。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"篃竹","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：篃竹，江間謂之箭竿。一尺數節，葉大如扇，可以衣篷。江漢之間謂之{⺮敝}(音蒯。)竹。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"由梧竹","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《南方草木状》曰：由梧竹，吏民家种之，長三四丈，围一尺八九寸，作屋柱，出交趾。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《林邑記》曰：由梧，堪為屋梁柱。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"左思《吳都賦》曰：由梧有篁。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"○班皮竹","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《博物志》曰：洞庭虞帝之二女，啼，以涕揮竹，竹盡班。今下俊有班皮竹。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"篔簹(音芸當)","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"顧徽《廣州記》曰：箄竹，一名篔簹，節長一丈。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《吳錄》曰：始興曲江縣有篔簹竹，围尺五寸，節相去六七尺。夷人以為布葛。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《異苑》曰：建安有篔簹竹，節中有人，長尺許，頭足皆具。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：篔簹竹，大者中作甑。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"苦竹","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《永嘉郡記》曰：樂成縣民張廌者，隱居颐志，不應辟命。家有苦竹數十頃，在竹中為屋，恒居其中。王右軍聞而造之，廌逃避竹中，不與相見。一郡號為高士。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"射筒竹","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：射筒竹，薄肌而長，中著箭，因以為名。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"沙麻竹","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《南越志》曰：沙麻竹，人削以為弓。弓似弩，淮南所謂溪子弩也。或曰收麻竹，或曰粗麻竹。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：沙摩竹，廣桂皆植。大如茶碗，竹厚而空小，一人止擎一茎，堪為茅屋之椽梁也。其种者，即钐其竿，每截二尺許，釘入土，不逾月而生根葉，明年長芽，筍不三載而為林，蓋土地所宜也。(南人醃以鹽為筍笴。)","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"石麻竹","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"裴淵《廣州記》曰：石麻竹，劲利，削為刀，切像皮如截芋。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"苞竹","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"顧微《廣州記》曰：平乡縣有苞竹，堪作布。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《吳都賦》曰：苞筍抽節，往往萦結。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"雞頸竹","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：雞頸竹，篁之類。纖細，大者不過如指。疏葉黃皮，強脆無所堪施。筍美，青班色绿。江東山岗所饒也。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"○芦{⺮思}竹","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：此竹當是芦，出扬州東垂諸郡，浙江以東。可以為篪。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"{⺮函}竹","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：{⺮函}墮竹，大如腳指。虫食其筍皮，類繡，甚可愛。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"莽竹","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：莽，數節。(節間促也。)","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"粦刂竹","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：粦刂(音吝，)堅中。(竹類，其中實也。)","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"簢竹","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：簢(音闵，)筡(音徒。)中。(其中空也。)","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"仲竹","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：仲，無笐。(亦竹類，未詳。音航。)","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"{⺮曼}竹","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《禮斗威儀》曰：君乘水而王，其政太平，{⺮曼}紫脱為常生。","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《王子年拾遺記》曰：岑華山，在西海之西。有{⺮曼}竹，為箫管，吹之。若群鳳之鳴。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"漢竹","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：永昌有漢竹，围三尺餘。","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"利竹","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《廣志》曰：西南出利竹。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"林於竹","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：林於竹，葉薄而廣。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"晉竹","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《吳越春秋》曰：吳王聞越王盡心自守，賜之以書，增之以封。越王乃使大夫赍葛布十萬、狐皮五双、晉竹十庚，以答封禮。","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"沛竹","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"東方朔《神異經》曰：南方荒中有沛竹，其長百丈，围二丈五六尺，厚八九寸。可以為舡。其子美，食之，可以已瘡癘。(茂先曰：子，筍也。)","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"棘竹","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：棘竹，生交州諸郡。丛生，初有數十茎，大者二尺围，肉至厚，幾於實中。夷人破以為弓。枝節皆有刺，彼人种以為城，卒不可攻，萬震《異物志》所謂\"种為藩落，阻過曾墉\"者也。或卒倒根出，大如十石物，從橫相承，状如缲車。一名笆竹，見《三仓》。筍味落人鬢發。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"沉懷遠《南越志》曰：宋昌縣有棘竹，長十尋，大如瓮。其間短者，辄六七丈也。為竹丛薄，葉下有鉤刺，或有條末如芒針。","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《南州異物志》曰：棘竹，節有棘刺。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《嶺表錄異》曰：南土有刺竹，即枝上有刺，南人呼刺為刺勒。自根橫生，枝條展轉如織。雖野火焚燒，只燎細枝嫩葉。春丛生，轉复牢密。邕州舊以刺竹為牆，蠻蜒來侵，竟不能入。","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"{⺮畐}竹","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：{⺮畐}與由衙，厥體俱洪，围或累尺，{⺮畐}實衙空。南越之居，梁柱是供。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《異物志》曰：有竹曰{⺮畐}，其大數围，節間相去局促，中實滿，堅強。以為屋榱，斷截便以為棟梁。不复加斤斧也。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"弓竹","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《竹譜》曰：弓竹，出東垂諸山。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"簜竹","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《尚書·禹貢》曰：筿、簜既敷。","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：簜，竹。(竹別名也。《儀禮》曰：簜竹在建鼓之間。謂箫管之屬。)","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"筍(附)","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《爾雅》曰：筍，竹萌。(初生者。)","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《毛詩·韓奕》曰：其蔌維何？維筍及蒲。(筍，竹萌也。)","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《周禮·天官·醢人》曰：加豆之實，箈菹、筍菹。(箈，箭萌也；筍，竹萌也。)","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《東觀漢記》曰：馬嶽炅荔浦，見冬筍，名苞筍。上言：\"《禹貢》'厥苞橘柚'，疑謂是也。\"其味美於春夏筍。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《續晉安帝紀》曰：豫州刺史司馬尚之，為桓玄將冯該所攻，仓储稍竭，或曰：\"戰士多飢，悉未付食。\"是時，芦筍時也，尚掷旮筍曰：\"且啖此，足解三日。\"將士離心，遂败。","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《呂氏春秋》曰：味之美者，越骆之箘。(高誘曰：筍也。)","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《華陽國志》曰：何隨，字季業。有竹園，人盜其筍者，隨行見之，恐驚，乃挈履而歸。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《荆州圖》曰：筑陽薤山上有孤竹，三年而生一蜀。筍成，代謝常一。","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《衬搡先賢傳》曰：孟宗，字恭武，至孝。母好食竹筍，宗入林中哀號，方冬，筍為之出，因以供養。時人皆以為孝感所致。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《南史》曰：沉道虔，有人拔其屋後筍，令人止之，曰：\"隙菟筍欲令成林，更有佳者相與。\"乃令人買大筍送與，盜者慚，不取，道虔使置其門內而還。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《筍譜》曰：筍者，竹之白蒻也，竹之丑節种。(凡草木有白蒻嫩而堪食者，皆曰白蒻也。)厥性弱於木而強於草，實草木中別類也。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"陆龟蒙《筍賦》曰：洪纖靡定，方圓不均。(南方有方竹。)","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_963_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_963","text":"《太平御覽》　宋·李昉","sortOrder":121}],"overrides":{}}